| Category | Definition | Scope | Speed | Dependencies | When to Use |
|----------|------------|-------|-------|--------------|-------------|
| **Unit** | Single function/class in isolation | Pure logic, no I/O | ⚡⚡⚡⚡⚡ (ms) | None | Always |
