| **Lifecycle** | Startup/shutdown behavior | App initialization, cleanup | ⚡⚡ (10-30s) | In-memory | For critical paths |
| **Regression** | Preserve existing behavior | **Purpose**, not type - can be unit/integration | Varies | Varies | After bug fixes |
